          <rdf:li>Adora gets to have nice things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra gets to have nice things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer gets to have a dad</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow gets to have a break</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Friendship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>a variety of fiber and fiber-adjacent arts</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)'s A+ Parenting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but only around the edges</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But mostly fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>the fluff is from sheep</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but they're fantasy sheep so they're blue</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>is this more or less niche than the arthurian au?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>character studies disguised as whatever the fuck this is</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
